---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base>
  <div class="screenplay">

    <div class="scene-heading">INT. MYSTERIOUS SPACE - NIGHT</div>

    <p class="action">Nothingness. White. The world's most boring website?</p>
    <p class="action">Then...a man appears. <span class="pop">Pop!</span></p>
    <p class="action">This is <strong>MIKE BATTLE</strong>. Part English, part Irish, with the skin tone to match. Nervous that you'll like his nerdy website.</p>

    <p class="character">MIKE</p>
    <p class="dialogue">Hi, I'm Mike! Welcome to my own little space on the internet.</p>

    <p class="action">A beat. He waits awkwardly. Like a Nintendo Wii avatar.</p>

    <p class="character">MIKE (CONT'D)</p>
    <p class="dialogue">Oh, you want to know about me, right?</p>

    <p class="dialogue">
      Well,
      for you entertainment industry folks,
      by day I'm a screenwriter
      repped by <a class="inline-link" href="https://www.curtisbrown.co.uk/client/mike-battle" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Curtis Brown</a>,
      and by night I run the Red Carpet Rookies <a class="inline-link" href="https://podcasts.apple.com/gb/podcast/red-carpet-rookies/id1529608643" target="_blank" rel="noopener">podcast</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="dialogue">
      It's a passion project of mine that aims to demystify the film/tv industry via career stories from existing pros.
    </p>

    <p class="dialogue">
      I've been lucky enough to be featured by Vanity Fair and the BBC, with guests that hold over 150 Oscar &amp; BAFTA nominations.
    </p>

    <p class="paren">(then)</p>

    <p class="dialogue">
      <em>For the non-industry folks</em>,
      I'm also a freelance Youtube strategist, writer, and new media obsessive. I've packaged videos for clients such as
      <a class="inline-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/timferriss" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tim Ferriss</a>
      (working for Clickables) and written 1,000,000+ view videos for creators like
      <a class="inline-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/@aliabdaal/videos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ali Abdaal</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="dialogue">
      Anyway, if you'd like to learn more about me or reach out —
      <a class="inline-link" href="/contact">drop me a line</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="dialogue">Cheers!</p>


  </div>
</Base>
